  "authPrivacyTitle": "Privacy & Terms",
  "authPrivacyHeroTitle": "Your data matters to us",
  "authPrivacyLastUpdated": "Last updated: March 1, 2026",
  "authPrivacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "authPrivacySection1Title": "1. Data collected",
  "authPrivacySection1Body": "When you create a Luckymam account, we collect:\n\n• Your name and email address\n• Your due date (pregnancy)\n• Your baby's date of birth\n• Information about your children (first name, date of birth)\n• Photo capsules and life moments you choose to share\n• Health data you voluntarily enter (vaccines, medical follow-up)",
  "authPrivacySection2Title": "2. Use of your data",
  "authPrivacySection2Body": "Your data is used exclusively to:\n\n• Provide app features (Timeline, Capsules, Vaccines)\n• Personalize your experience based on your maternal profile\n• Send you relevant reminders and notifications\n• Improve our services in an anonymous, aggregated way\n\nWe never sell or share your personal data with third parties for commercial purposes.",
  "authPrivacySection3Title": "3. Storage & Security",
  "authPrivacySection3Body": "Your data is stored securely on Firebase servers (Google Cloud Platform), ISO 27001 certified and GDPR compliant.\n\n• Encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256)\n• Access restricted to your account via secure authentication\n• Encrypted automatic backups",
  "authPrivacySection4Title": "4. Your rights (GDPR)",
  "authPrivacySection4Body": "Under the General Data Protection Regulation, you have the following rights:\n\n• Right of access to your personal data\n• Right to rectification of inaccurate data\n• Right to erasure (« right to be forgotten »)\n• Right to data portability\n• Right to object to processing\n\nTo exercise these rights: privacy@Luckymam.com",
  "authPrivacySection5Title": "5. Data retention",
  "authPrivacySection5Body": "Your data is retained while your account is active. If you delete your account, all personal data is erased within 30 days.\n\nYou can request deletion from: Profile → Settings → Delete my account.",
  "authTermsTitle": "Terms of Use",
  "authTermsSection1Title": "1. Acceptance of terms",
  "authTermsSection1Body": "By creating an account and using the Luckymam app, you accept these terms of use in full. If you do not accept these terms, please do not use the app.",
  "authTermsSection2Title": "2. Service description",
  "authTermsSection2Body": "Luckymam is a mobile app dedicated to supporting mothers on their maternity journey. It offers:\n\n• Creating and preserving life photo capsules\n• Tracking the Timeline of important moments\n• Tracking your child's vaccinations\n• Access to educational Reels on pregnancy and motherhood\n• Premium and VIP subscription features",
  "authTermsSection3Title": "3. Responsibilities",
  "authTermsSection3Body": "Luckymam is not a medical service and does not replace advice from a healthcare professional. Information provided (vaccination schedule, pregnancy advice) is for guidance only.\n\nYou are responsible for keeping your login credentials confidential and for the accuracy of the information you enter.",
  "authTermsSection4Title": "4. Subscriptions & Billing",
  "authTermsSection4Body": "Luckymam offers three access levels:\n\n• Free: basic features\n• Premium: 2,490 DA/year — access to all advanced features\n• VIP: 9,890 DA/year — personalized VIP card + exclusive partners\n\nSubscriptions renew automatically. You can cancel anytime from your subscription area.",
  "authTermsSection5Title": "5. Changes",
  "authTermsSection5Body": "Luckymam reserves the right to modify these terms at any time. Any change will be notified by email and in the app. Continued use after notification constitutes acceptance of the new terms.",
  "authPrivacyQuestionsTitle": "Questions?",
  "authPrivacyContactEmail": "Contact us at privacy@Luckymam.com",
